  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://patreon.com/techthedev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://intellitonic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/become_a_patron_button@2x.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/eZ6GpXQXGC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/853294489636831242?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=ffffff&color=5865f2&link=https://discord.gg/uBhFaBG\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheRealTechDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/TheRealTechDev?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=black&labelColor=white&color=#101013\" alt=\"在 X（前身為 Twitter）上追蹤\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/lux-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/863609?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=#f16436&labelColor=ffffff\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252flux-v1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/DiGQENDV?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=#16a869&labelColor=ffffff\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/p2kIQGi.jpg\" alt=\"Imgur\"></p>\n<p>Lux 是一款高畫質的 Minecraft Java 版著色器包，基於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbitslablab.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Capt Tatsu 的 BSL Shaders</a>。</p>\n<p>預設情況下，Lux 專為中階至高階使用者設計，但提供了廣泛的設定選項，讓你能完全客製化這款著色器。在力求與各種硬體及軟體規格高度相容、視覺美觀且不干擾遊戲體驗的同時，Lux 也融入了許多實驗性且少見的功能。它正在頻繁更新，雖然對遊戲來說仍屬新作，但已採用更現代化的技術來呈現出色的視覺效果，絕對是你不容錯過的著色器包。</p>\n<h2>錯誤回報</h2>\n<p>如果您遇到任何問題，請使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/TechDevOnGitHub/Lux-Shader/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 問題追蹤器</a>。</p>",
